# The shear sigil bends stone walls into a decorative path.
# Shared floor and wall tiles keep every shape in the same source theme.
# The controller draws it by tag and weight; its MAP geometry stays here.
NAME:    serial_sigils_hangedman_shear
TAGS:    allow_dup transparent extra decor serial_sigils
WEIGHT:  5
DEPTH:   Depths, Elf, Crypt, Abyss
SHUFFLE: CD
SUBST:   a : c..., b : c..., C : cc., D : c:8 .:1, E : cc., F : cc.
TILE: c = wall_stone_dark
FTILE: . = floor_volcanic
FTILE: c = floor_pebble_darkgray w:99 / floor_rough_red w:1
MAP
            .F.
  ...      ..c.
  Dc...    .c...E.
.C..cc... ..c...c..
.c....cc...c.....c.
..c.....cc.c..b..c..
 .c..a.........a..c.
 ..c..b..c.cc.....c..
  .c.....c...cc....c.
  ..c...c.. ...cc..D.
   .E...c.    ...cC
      .c..      ...
      .F.
ENDMAP
